---
title: CST8244 Assignment 1 - Building Entry Controller FSM
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE

    IDLE --> LEFT_SCAN : ls &lt;id&gt;
    IDLE --> RIGHT_SCAN : rs &lt;id&gt;

    LEFT_SCAN --> LEFT_UNLOCKED : glu
    RIGHT_SCAN --> RIGHT_UNLOCKED : gru

    LEFT_UNLOCKED --> LEFT_OPEN : lo
    RIGHT_UNLOCKED --> RIGHT_OPEN : ro

    LEFT_OPEN --> WEIGHED : ws &lt;wt&gt;
    RIGHT_OPEN --> WEIGHED : ws &lt;wt&gt;

    WEIGHED --> LEFT_CLOSED : lc
    WEIGHED --> RIGHT_CLOSED : rc

    LEFT_CLOSED --> LEFT_LOCKED : gll
    RIGHT_CLOSED --> RIGHT_LOCKED : grl

    LEFT_LOCKED --> RIGHT_UNLOCKED : gru
    RIGHT_LOCKED --> LEFT_UNLOCKED : glu

    LEFT_OPEN --> LEFT_CLOSED : lc
    RIGHT_OPEN --> RIGHT_CLOSED : rc

    LEFT_LOCKED --> IDLE : ls / rs (new person)
    RIGHT_LOCKED --> IDLE : ls / rs (new person)

    IDLE --> [*] : exit

    note right of WEIGHED
        Weighing happens only at the FIRST (entry) door.
        At the SECOND (exit) door the person just passes
        through: the door opens then closes (no ws).
    end note
    note left of IDLE
        exit is accepted in ANY state and
        terminates the controller (EXIT_STATE).
        Any event that is not valid for the current
        state is ignored - the person is kept in the
        same state (quarantine).
    end note
